      "summary_en": "If cast on an ally, grants them Attack Speed and Move Speed for a short time. If cast on an enemy, turns them into an adorable critter that can't attack or cast spells.",
      "summary_zh": "如果对友军施放，会暂时增加目标友军的攻击速度和移动速度。如果对敌人施放，会将一名敌方英雄变成可爱的动物，使其无法攻击或施法。",
