      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "If cast on an ally, commands Pix to jump to an ally and shield them. He then follows them and aids their attacks. If cast on an enemy, commands Pix to jump to an enemy and damage them. He then follows them and grants you vision of that enemy.",
      "summary_zh": "如果对友军施放，会命令皮克斯跳到一名友军身上进行保护，之后会跟随并协助目标（而不是璐璐）进行攻击。如果对敌人施放，皮克斯会跳到敌人身上造成伤害，之后会跟随并提供目标的视野。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1308186:3945270"
      ]
    },
